{
  "name": "dsh-agent-skill-forge",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "被动技能熔炉（Trace2Skill 思想落地）：后台采集会话轨迹索引（零 LLM 成本）+ 信号送达；蒸馏/合并/剪枝决策归爱丽丝；产物三态（2026-09-16 语义扩充）——guidance/workflow → SKILL.md（DSH 技能目录原生可加载），tool → 跨会话累积的工具候选台账（工具载体是插件，不是技能目录）；压缩提醒可关（compactHintEnabled，2026-09-14 默认关闭）",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/types/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/types/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "README.md",
    "dsh-plugin.json"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "allowScripts": [],
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.1-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "^0.1.0-rc.6",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-session": "^0.1.0-rc.6",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": "^0.1.0-rc.6",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-token-meter": "^0.1.0-rc.6"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^22.0.0",
    "typescript": "^5.9.3"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit",
    "test": "node --test \"tests/*.test.mjs\""
  }
}
